<div class="ar-field ar-cover-field">커버
    <span class="ar-file">
        <input type="file" name="thumbnail" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp,image/gif,image/bmp,.jpg,.jpeg,.jfif,.png,.webp,.gif,.bmp" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="ar-file-name" data-file-name hidden>선택된 파일 없음</span>
    </span>
    <div class="ar-cover-picker" data-cover-picker>
        <div class="ar-cover-stage">
            <img data-cover-stage-image alt="선택한 커버" hidden>
            <p class="ar-cover-empty" data-cover-empty>영상을 선택하면 프레임에서 커버를 고르거나 갤러리 사진을 넣을 수 있습니다.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ar-cover-rail">
            <div class="ar-cover-frames" data-cover-frames role="listbox" aria-label="영상 프레임" aria-busy="false"></div>
            <button type="button" class="ar-cover-gallery" data-cover-gallery aria-label="갤러리에서 커버 선택">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 5.75A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 6.75 4h10.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 19 5.75v10.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 17.25 18H6.75A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 5 16.25V5.75Zm1.75-.25a.25.25 0 0 0-.25.25v7.19l2.22-2.22a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0L13 14.19l1.72-1.72a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0L17.5 14.19V5.75a.25.25 0 0 0-.25-.25H6.75ZM9 9.25a1.25 1.25 0 1 0 0-2.5 1.25 1.25 0 0 0 0 2.5Z"/><path d="M12 19.25a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v1.25h1.25a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5H12.75V24a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-1.25H10a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h1.25V20a.75.75 0 0 1 .75-.75Z"/></svg>
                <span>갤러리</span>
            </button>
        </div>
        <div class="ar-cover-meta">
            <p class="ar-cover-status" data-thumbnail-info></p>
            <button type="button" class="ar-text-btn" data-thumbnail-clear>커버 초기화</button>
        </div>
    </div>
    <span class="ar-field-hint">프레임을 고르지 않으면 첫 장면이 커버가 됩니다. 세로·가로 모두 잘리지 않게 표시됩니다.</span>
</div>
<div class="ar-thumbnail-preview" data-thumbnail-preview hidden>
    <img alt="">
</div>
<p class="ar-preview-error" data-thumbnail-error role="alert" hidden></p>
